          "through_frame": 725248
        },
        {
          "speaker": "assistant",
          "audio_id": "A003",
          "text": "可以说“Tonight is fine, if that works for you.”，重点是“今晚也可以”，而不是要求今晚完成。若还想更随和，可说“Tonight is fine, but no rush.”",
          "through_frame": 932608
        },
        {
          "speaker": "user",
          "audio_id": "U04",
          "text": "还有一次，对方在英文消息最后保留了中文“辛苦了”，然后又问我这是什么意思。我觉得挺亲近的，但这种情况是不是不该直接保留中文？",
          "through_frame": 1104128
        },
        {
          "speaker": "assistant",
          "audio_id": "A004",
          "text": "可以保留，但最好立刻加一个简短释义，例如“辛苦了—thanks for taking care of this”。",
          "through_frame": 1228288
        }
      ],
      "current_frame": 1228288,
      "clock": "synthetic_pcm_16000",
      "assistant_speaking": true
    },
    "event_added_to_assistant_context": true
  }
